import{_ as e,o as t,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 234 | Realm and Technology: Whole-Realm Application of Cultivation-Law Technicization","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 234 | Realm and Technology: Whole-Realm Application of Cultivation-Law Technicization","no":234,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Technology","Law Technicization","Tech Application"],"related":["60-Technology System Overview","61-Multiplication Fruit Engineering Application","62-Space Jurisprudence Technical Implementation"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0234_模块1-境界与科技-修炼法则技术化全境应用.md","filePath":"en/0234_模块1-境界与科技-修炼法则技术化全境应用.md"}'),a={name:"en/0234_模块1-境界与科技-修炼法则技术化全境应用.md"};function r(l,i,s,c,h,u){return t(),n("div",null,[...i[0]||(i[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-234-realm-and-technology-whole-realm-application-of-cultivation-law-technicization" tabindex="-1">Entry 234 | Realm and Technology: Whole-Realm Application of Cultivation-Law Technicization <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-234-realm-and-technology-whole-realm-application-of-cultivation-law-technicization" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 234 | Realm and Technology: Whole-Realm Application of Cultivation-Law Technicization&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 60, 61, 62</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-turning-personal-insights-into-public-technology" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Turning personal insights into public technology <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-turning-personal-insights-into-public-technology" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Turning personal insights into public technology&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou (Wanling Hengmao Origin Cosmos)&#39;s technology system&#39;s core feature is &quot;cultivation-law technicization&quot; — turning law principles personally perceived by cultivators into reproducible, promotable, universally beneficial technology tools. This makes high-realm cultivators&#39; results no longer just personal experience, but public technology products usable by whole society.</p><p>The six top-level axioms are directly embodied in the relationship between realm and technology: the anti-predation axiom requires technology not be monopolized; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires technology be open to Myriad Races; the collective ascension axiom requires technology drive collective ascension; the causal self-discipline axiom constrains technology application not to disturb karma; the law-first axiom ensures technology principles are based on law self-consistency, no retcon; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>This entry analyzes how law technicization is applied across all realms.</p><h2 id="i-five-tiers-of-law-technicization" tabindex="-1">I. Five Tiers of Law Technicization <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-five-tiers-of-law-technicization" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Five Tiers of Law Technicization&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Tech Tier</th><th>Correspondence Realm</th><th>Tech Type</th><th>Application Scope</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Perception assist tech</td><td>Sense - Condensed Origin</td><td>Perception guidance devices, energy sample library</td><td>All cultivators</td></tr><tr><td>Circulation optimization tech</td><td>Condensed - Transform Origin</td><td>Internal circulation simulator, loss monitor</td><td>Mid-tier cultivators</td></tr><tr><td>Transformation tool tech</td><td>Transform - Law Origin</td><td>Tuning assistor, conversion efficiency optimizer</td><td>High-tier cultivators</td></tr><tr><td>Law engineering tech</td><td>Law - Dao Origin</td><td>Law modeling tools, domain design software</td><td>Master-tier cultivators</td></tr><tr><td>World-creation engineering tech</td><td>World-Creation - Origin</td><td>Isolated space builder, law weaving platform</td><td>World-level strong ones</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="ii-perception-assist-tech-tech-universalization-for-sense-condensed-origin" tabindex="-1">II. Perception Assist Tech: Tech Universalization for Sense - Condensed Origin <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-perception-assist-tech-tech-universalization-for-sense-condensed-origin" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Perception Assist Tech: Tech Universalization for Sense - Condensed Origin&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The hardest part for Sense Origin cultivators is &quot;perceiving energy for the first time.&quot; The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization has lowered this threshold through technicized means:</p><ul><li><strong>Perception guidance wave</strong>: the anchor network emits specific-frequency guidance waves, helping cultivators&#39; consciousness enter perception mode</li><li><strong>Energy sample library</strong>: standardized energy samples for cultivators to practice identification</li><li><strong>Perception precision assessor</strong>: quantitatively assessing the seven levels of perception precision (see Entry 217)</li></ul><p>These technologies turn Sense Origin entry from &quot;all by talent&quot; into &quot;having methods to follow,&quot; greatly lowering the entry threshold.</p><h2 id="iii-circulation-optimization-tech-efficiency-improvement-for-condensed-transform-origin" tabindex="-1">III. Circulation Optimization Tech: Efficiency Improvement for Condensed - Transform Origin <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-circulation-optimization-tech-efficiency-improvement-for-condensed-transform-origin" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Circulation Optimization Tech: Efficiency Improvement for Condensed - Transform Origin&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Condensed Origin&#39;s internal circulation construction and Transform Origin&#39;s energy transformation can both be optimized through technology tools:</p><ul><li><strong>Internal circulation simulator</strong>: testing different circulation paths&#39; efficiency in virtual environments</li><li><strong>Loss monitor</strong>: real-time monitoring of energy conversion loss rate, warning above threshold</li><li><strong>Purity analyzer</strong>: precisely analyzing energy purity, guiding purification direction</li></ul><p>These technologies turn internal circulation construction from &quot;by feel&quot; into &quot;by data,&quot; efficiency improved several-fold.</p><h2 id="iv-transformation-tool-tech-precision-guarantee-for-transform-law-origin" tabindex="-1">IV. Transformation Tool Tech: Precision Guarantee for Transform - Law Origin <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-transformation-tool-tech-precision-guarantee-for-transform-law-origin" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Transformation Tool Tech: Precision Guarantee for Transform - Law Origin&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Transform Origin&#39;s tuning transformation and Law Origin&#39;s law perception both require high-precision tools:</p><ul><li><strong>Frequency tuning assistor</strong>: helping cultivators precisely adjust energy frequency, lowering transformation loss</li><li><strong>Law index database</strong>: whole-network structured index of law information, convenient for cultivators to compare</li><li><strong>Perception calibration tool</strong>: using standard law samples to calibrate cultivators&#39; law perception</li></ul><h2 id="v-law-engineering-tech-systematic-r-d-for-law-dao-origin" tabindex="-1">V. Law Engineering Tech: Systematic R&amp;D for Law - Dao Origin <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-law-engineering-tech-systematic-r-d-for-law-dao-origin" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Law Engineering Tech: Systematic R&amp;D for Law - Dao Origin&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law Origin and Dao Origin cultivators begin systematic law research; technology tools also upgrade to engineering tier:</p><ul><li><strong>Law modeling platform</strong>: modeling laws&#39; operation, simulation verification</li><li><strong>Domain design software</strong>: assisting in designing personal law domains&#39; structure and parameters</li><li><strong>Dao-rule distillation workshop</strong>: multiple mentors + AI-assisted Dao-rule distillation tool</li></ul><h2 id="vi-world-creation-engineering-tech-ultimate-tools-for-world-creation-origin" tabindex="-1">VI. World-Creation Engineering Tech: Ultimate Tools for World-Creation - Origin <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-world-creation-engineering-tech-ultimate-tools-for-world-creation-origin" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. World-Creation Engineering Tech: Ultimate Tools for World-Creation - Origin&quot;">​</a></h2><p>World-Creation and Origin Realm strong ones use the top-tier engineering technologies:</p><ul><li><strong>Isolated space builder</strong>: assisting in opening and stabilizing isolated space</li><li><strong>Law weaving platform</strong>: visual design of the world&#39;s law framework</li><li><strong>Self-consistency verification system</strong>: fully auto-verifying whether the designed law system is self-consistent</li></ul><h2 id="vii-multiplication-fruit-technicization-s-whole-realm-impact" tabindex="-1">VII. Multiplication Fruit Technicization&#39;s Whole-Realm Impact <a class="header-anchor" href="#vii-multiplication-fruit-technicization-s-whole-realm-impact" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VII. Multiplication Fruit Technicization&#39;s Whole-Realm Impact&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Multiplication Fruit technology (Documents 16, 61) is the most typical example of law technicization — turning &quot;hundredfold deduction amplification&quot; from personal talent into a technicizable public tool. This technicization&#39;s impact covers all realms:</p><ul><li>Sense Origin cultivators use Multiplication Fruit to accelerate perception training</li><li>Transform Origin cultivators use Multiplication Fruit to accelerate transformation technology R&amp;D</li><li>Dao Origin cultivators use Multiplication Fruit to accelerate Dao-rule distillation</li><li>Origin Realm strong ones use Multiplication Fruit to accelerate law fine-tuning&#39;s simulation verification</li></ul><p>Multiplication Fruit technicization is the &quot;cultivation-law technicization&quot; axiom&#39;s most typical realization — turning talent only a few can have into tools everyone can use.</p><h2 id="viii-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">VIII. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#viii-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VIII. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: technicization turns personal insights into public tools, one insight benefits ten million, avoiding repeated groping</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: all technologies are openly shared, no &quot;tech monopoly&quot; exists; the Predatory Faction&#39;s &quot;tech secrecy&quot; does not exist in the Anchor Civilization</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo systems&#39; technology (soul ring technology) is monopolized by sects and relies on predation; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s law technologies are all free and open</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: all technology tools have adapted versions for every Myriad Races group</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the technology system upgrades with realm expansion, cross-cosmic-level technology synchronously developed</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The essence of cultivation-law technicization is turning &quot;personal cultivation experience&quot; into &quot;public technology products.&quot; In predatory-faction systems, cultivators&#39; insights are private property, attained then hoarded; in the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, cultivators&#39; insights through technicization become public tools, one person&#39;s breakthrough benefits ten million. This is the collective ascension axiom in technology&#39;s concrete realization.</p><p>In the final analysis, realm and technology · whole-realm application of cultivation-law technicization described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./60-技术体系总览.html">60-Technology System Overview</a> · <a href="./61-倍增果实工程化应用.html">61-Multiplication Fruit Engineering Application</a> · <a href="./62-空间法理技术实现.html">62-Space Jurisprudence Technical Implementation</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',36)])])}const p=e(a,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
